# Costaff ATS — Master Specification & Implementation Plan

> **Goal**: Automate **Costaff_Master Tracker_V.1.xlsx** (261 MB, 9 sheets) into a real-time web application with exact UI styling from [https://costf.netlify.app/](https://costf.netlify.app/) and 100% feature alignment with Software System Details (§5–§6).

---

## 1. Core Principles

- 🚀 **100% Live Data (No Mocking)**: All KPI cards, charts, and tables update in real time via live database connections & API routes.
- 🎨 **Exact UI Parity**: Dark glassmorphic theme, 8-section sidebar navigation, 6 KPI cards with sparklines, SVG conversion funnel, and performance tables matching [costf.netlify.app](https://costf.netlify.app/).
- ⚡ **Complete Excel Automation**: Automatic import of all 9 sheets into relational database tables, eliminating manual spreadsheet updating.

